    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/architect-construction/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Architect Construction is a modern, versatile, and professional theme designed for architects, construction companies, building contractors, real estate developers, interior designers, architectural firms, property managers, engineering consultancies, civil engineering firms, residential builders, commercial construction companies, renovation specialists, and sustainable architecture studios. Ideal for showcasing projects, building portfolios, construction services, architectural designs, project planning, site management, and design consultations, this theme provides a visually appealing platform to attract clients and highlight professional expertise. Featuring a clean, responsive, and mobile-friendly layout, it ensures seamless user experiences across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Key features include sections for project galleries, service highlights, team profiles, client testimonials, interactive banners, and strategically placed Call to Action (CTA) buttons. With extensive customization options for colors, layouts, and typography, you can tailor the site to reflect your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service bookings and payments, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and WPML for multilingual support, Architect Construction is a complete, user-friendly, and SEO-optimized solution for building a professional online presence in the architecture and construction industry. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/architect-construction/"
    },
